WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.070 --> 01:38.900
=Episode 1=

01:48.140 --> 01:49.660
(Huai Dynasty, Yingxiang 21, Spring)
(In the 21st year of Yingxiang,)

01:50.500 --> 01:52.140
(Princess Danyang, Mu Wanyao,)

01:52.580 --> 01:53.900
(visited Mount Lufu
to honor her late mother.)

01:53.900 --> 01:54.820
(Caimei Ridge, Lingnan Circuit)

01:54.820 --> 01:55.220
(On her way back,)

01:55.980 --> 01:58.220
(she passed through Caimei Ridge
in Lingnan Circuit.)

02:02.740 --> 02:03.420
(Something's wrong! Something's wrong!)

02:04.100 --> 02:04.500
(Somebody, help!)

02:04.700 --> 02:05.300
(A wheel spoke has snapped!)

02:05.300 --> 02:06.140
(This road is terrible!)

02:06.220 --> 02:07.020
(Grab a wooden pole to prop it up!)

02:07.340 --> 02:07.900
(Coming!)

02:09.540 --> 02:11.700
My lady, one of the carriage's
wheel spokes has broken.

02:20.300 --> 02:22.740
(Mu Wanyao, Princess Danyang)

02:22.740 --> 02:23.620
What a wretched place!

02:25.340 --> 02:29.500
(Chunhua, Princess Danyang's Maid)

02:29.580 --> 02:30.060
My lady.

02:31.060 --> 02:32.580
Do you think there really are tigers
in these mountains?

02:34.220 --> 02:35.340
This is Lingnan,

02:35.500 --> 02:36.380
not Sheng'an.

02:37.060 --> 02:37.820
Forget tigers and leopards.

02:38.460 --> 02:39.860
Even spirits and monsters

02:40.180 --> 02:41.180
wouldn't be surprising here.

02:43.140 --> 02:43.660
My lady.

02:44.420 --> 02:45.460
The carriage has a broken wheel spoke.

02:45.660 --> 02:46.700
It'll take two hours to replace.

02:47.460 --> 02:48.420
(Fang Tong, Princess Danyang's Guard)
We're still far from the relay station.

02:48.740 --> 02:50.180
We can either
risk pressing on after dark

02:50.500 --> 02:51.540
or spend the night here.

02:52.140 --> 02:52.820
What would you prefer?

03:44.020 --> 03:44.500
My lady!

03:45.260 --> 03:45.940
There really are monsters here!

04:37.060 --> 04:40.540
♪Moonlight shimmers upon the pond♪

04:41.140 --> 04:44.660
♪Riding a bamboo horse
past the red pond♪

04:45.060 --> 04:48.540
♪The water's too deep to cross♪

04:48.940 --> 04:52.460
♪A maiden rows to fetch her love♪

04:52.940 --> 04:56.420
♪She asks her sweetheart this and that♪

04:56.820 --> 05:00.340
♪When you leave again,
when will you be back?♪

05:04.940 --> 05:05.780
You insolent rogue!

05:06.180 --> 05:07.420
What are you staring at my lady for?

05:11.980 --> 05:13.260
Are you heading across Caimei Ridge,
my lady?

05:13.940 --> 05:14.620
What's it to you?

05:20.260 --> 05:21.300
Another five li ahead,

05:21.820 --> 05:22.420
you'll reach the official road.

05:23.100 --> 05:24.180
Follow it east,

05:24.460 --> 05:25.300
and you'll find a relay station.

05:26.820 --> 05:28.060
Did anyone ask you for directions?

05:29.220 --> 05:30.020
Besides,

05:30.740 --> 05:32.300
how do I know
you're not just making it up?

05:34.740 --> 05:35.460
You have a point, my lady.

05:35.980 --> 05:37.020
You can never be too careful.

05:37.780 --> 05:38.220
I'll be off, then.

05:39.100 --> 05:39.620
Stop right there.

05:51.700 --> 05:52.500
Where are you going?

05:53.140 --> 05:53.700
Home.

05:55.900 --> 05:57.260
No luggage,

05:57.540 --> 05:58.420
and traveling on foot at dusk.

05:59.060 --> 05:59.780
Your home

06:00.260 --> 06:01.260
must be somewhere in these mountains.

06:03.540 --> 06:03.860
It is.

06:05.780 --> 06:06.660
Then lead the way.

06:08.340 --> 06:09.220
Wonderful, my lady!

06:09.780 --> 06:11.220
We won't have to sleep out
in the wilderness tonight!

06:13.260 --> 06:13.580
Well...

06:14.860 --> 06:15.620
My home is rather small.

06:15.940 --> 06:17.020
I'm afraid there isn't room
for so many guests.

06:20.260 --> 06:21.260
You sure talk too much.

06:26.140 --> 06:27.500
You're not afraid
I might be a liar anymore?

06:29.540 --> 06:30.380
With that build of yours,

06:30.860 --> 06:31.940
even if you meant me harm,

06:32.300 --> 06:33.180
who could you possibly hurt?

06:54.820 --> 06:55.980
You're a strange one.

06:56.660 --> 06:57.620
It's not even dark yet.

06:58.580 --> 06:59.900
Why have you lit a torch already?

07:01.220 --> 07:02.060
These woods are remote,

07:02.460 --> 07:03.300
and we often run into wild animals.

07:03.660 --> 07:05.140
Even by day, we carry torches
when we travel through the mountains.

07:06.020 --> 07:07.460
You're a traveler from elsewhere,
aren't you, my lady?

07:09.860 --> 07:10.740
What's your name?

07:11.420 --> 07:11.980
My surname is Yan.

07:12.540 --> 07:13.380
I'm the second child in my family.

07:17.260 --> 07:17.860
Yan Shang.

07:18.820 --> 07:20.220
Who else lives with you?

07:21.380 --> 07:22.460
(Yan Shang)
My elderly father,

07:22.860 --> 07:23.540
an older brother, and a younger sister.

07:24.420 --> 07:25.380
And what should I call you, my lady?

07:26.300 --> 07:28.300
There isn't a village or inn
in these mountains.

07:28.980 --> 07:30.580
Why is yours the only family
living out here?

07:31.980 --> 07:32.980
Are you refugees

07:33.260 --> 07:34.140
or outlaws?

07:35.500 --> 07:36.180
To tell you the truth, my lady,

07:36.780 --> 07:37.620
when I first saw you,

07:38.060 --> 07:39.500
surrounded by attendants
in the middle of nowhere,

07:39.940 --> 07:40.660
a beautiful lady traveling alone,

07:41.500 --> 07:42.980
I thought you might be a fox spirit
or a seductive ghost.

07:48.660 --> 07:50.420
(What a temper this lady has.)

08:00.300 --> 08:00.740
My lady.

08:01.220 --> 08:01.980
My home is rather humble.

08:02.900 --> 08:03.940
Are you sure you want to stay?

08:09.620 --> 08:10.180
Guards!

08:12.780 --> 08:13.700
Clear out

08:14.260 --> 08:14.860
these two rooms.

08:15.180 --> 08:15.620
I'll be using them.

08:15.740 --> 08:16.540
Yes, my lady!

08:18.660 --> 08:18.980
(Over here!)

08:18.980 --> 08:19.820
- (Here!)
- (Check over here!)

08:19.820 --> 08:20.260
(Tear this place down!)

08:20.260 --> 08:20.980
(Replace that stool!)

08:21.700 --> 08:24.500
♪Dark clouds gather, rain's on its way♪

08:24.500 --> 08:26.100
(Move aside! Make way! Clear the path!)

08:26.340 --> 08:26.740
(Hurry up!)

08:27.340 --> 08:28.100
(Move it! Faster!)

08:28.980 --> 08:29.340
(Got it!)

08:32.460 --> 08:33.740
Who are you people?

08:33.860 --> 08:35.100
Where are you taking me?

08:35.900 --> 08:36.900
There's a young lady here too?

08:38.140 --> 08:39.420
What's so strange about that?

08:39.420 --> 08:42.900
♪Oh, what a funny sight♪

08:43.460 --> 08:44.180
My wine!

08:44.700 --> 08:46.380
My wine!

08:47.540 --> 08:50.420
♪Grandma wants it bland♪

08:51.020 --> 08:51.380
Father!

08:51.380 --> 08:52.260
Shang! Shang! Quick!

08:52.260 --> 08:52.580
Father!

08:52.740 --> 08:54.060
- Throw them out!
- Father! Father!

08:54.340 --> 08:55.500
There's more wine! There's more wine!

08:57.020 --> 08:57.580
Come on, get up!

08:57.940 --> 08:58.300
Father!

09:00.140 --> 09:00.540
Father!

09:01.340 --> 09:01.660
Father!

09:02.220 --> 09:02.980
Shang!

09:02.980 --> 09:04.580
♪Clang-a-lang♪

09:04.580 --> 09:07.140
(Yan Zhanzhi, Yan Shang's Father)

09:07.140 --> 09:08.700
My wine!

09:08.700 --> 09:09.060
Father!

09:09.660 --> 09:10.020
Father!

09:10.380 --> 09:10.900
Please, get up!

09:12.020 --> 09:13.460
Shang!

09:15.340 --> 09:16.180
I'll explain everything later.

09:16.180 --> 09:16.660
My wine!

09:16.660 --> 09:18.060
Father, there'll be more wine.

09:18.340 --> 09:19.100
Just sit inside.

09:19.260 --> 09:19.780
I'll handle this.

09:20.180 --> 09:23.180
♪Grandpa digs up a loach♪

09:23.460 --> 09:27.500
♪Oh, what a funny sight♪

09:27.500 --> 09:29.500
Shang!

09:29.900 --> 09:32.700
♪Grandpa wants it salty♪

09:33.100 --> 09:35.940
♪Grandma wants it bland♪

09:36.420 --> 09:40.980
♪They start a fight and smash the pot♪

09:42.980 --> 09:44.460
♪Yi-ya-ha-do♪

09:44.580 --> 09:47.580
♪Clang-a-lang, clang-a-lang♪
(Yan Dalang, Yan Shang's Older Brother)

09:47.580 --> 09:48.220
Shang!

09:48.380 --> 09:48.980
Father!

09:49.220 --> 09:49.820
Run!

09:50.060 --> 09:50.700
Run, Shang!

09:50.700 --> 09:51.140
Brother!

09:51.180 --> 09:51.980
(Yan Xiaozhou, Yan Shang's Sister)
Father, run!

09:52.060 --> 09:53.020
- Brother!
- Bandits are in our house!

09:53.020 --> 09:53.900
Let go of my brother!

09:53.900 --> 09:54.220
Move!

09:54.220 --> 09:55.420
Shang, run!

09:55.780 --> 09:57.100
Xiaozhou, run!

09:57.100 --> 09:57.580
Let him go!

09:57.580 --> 09:57.980
Out of the way!

10:00.100 --> 10:01.180
Who are you calling a bandit?

10:02.500 --> 10:03.540
There's a woman bandit too!

10:03.780 --> 10:04.980
Xiaozhou, run!

10:05.500 --> 10:06.100
Run!

10:06.780 --> 10:07.740
Brother! Brother!

10:08.100 --> 10:08.780
She's not a bandit.

10:08.980 --> 10:09.500
There are no bandits.

10:09.980 --> 10:10.540
Father's fine.

10:10.860 --> 10:11.540
We're all fine.

10:12.300 --> 10:12.660
It's okay.

10:12.780 --> 10:13.340
Yan Shang.

10:14.300 --> 10:15.220
Does no one in your family

10:15.780 --> 10:17.900
know how to treat people properly?

10:18.620 --> 10:20.260
Is there no law in this world?

10:20.260 --> 10:20.580
Father!

10:20.820 --> 10:21.460
Father!

10:22.260 --> 10:22.620
Father!

10:23.060 --> 10:24.060
I am the law.

10:36.820 --> 10:37.260
My lady.

10:37.740 --> 10:38.940
My brother has a mental disability.

10:39.180 --> 10:39.820
He meant no offense.

10:40.580 --> 10:41.540
Could you please have mercy on him?

10:42.180 --> 10:43.340
For a country bumpkin,

10:43.740 --> 10:44.780
you know what's good for you.

10:48.860 --> 10:50.500
- Shang is no country bumpkin!
- Brother!

10:51.100 --> 10:52.220
- He's not a bumpkin!
- Brother!

10:52.340 --> 10:52.620
Brother!

10:52.660 --> 10:53.020
Brother!

10:53.860 --> 10:54.820
Stop it. Don't say another word!

10:54.940 --> 10:55.980
- This is our house!
- Brother!

10:56.020 --> 10:56.340
Brother!

10:56.340 --> 10:56.980
Let me go!

10:56.980 --> 10:57.420
All right, all right.

10:57.860 --> 10:58.580
He's not a bumpkin!

10:58.580 --> 10:59.780
- Brother!
- Go get changed.

10:59.780 --> 11:00.460
This is our house!

11:00.460 --> 11:01.100
- Brother!
- I'll keep an eye on him.

11:01.300 --> 11:02.460
He's no country bumpkin!

11:02.660 --> 11:03.740
I'll throw them all out!

11:03.740 --> 11:04.780
Shang?

11:04.780 --> 11:05.780
Let me go!

11:07.780 --> 11:08.620
His name is Yan Shang.

11:10.620 --> 11:11.620
I was only trying to help
with directions.

11:12.340 --> 11:14.260
But they immediately ordered me
to lead them back to my house.

11:16.540 --> 11:17.620
I take that road every day.

11:18.300 --> 11:19.740
Never thought it'd bring so much trouble
to our door.

11:20.220 --> 11:21.380
It's not your fault, brother.

11:21.740 --> 11:22.660
If I'd run into her,

11:22.780 --> 11:23.980
I'd have let her stay too.

11:24.900 --> 11:26.300
That woman is clearly
used to getting her way.

11:27.260 --> 11:28.660
She must be from
some prominent household.

11:32.260 --> 11:33.420
Let's just hope they stay one night

11:33.940 --> 11:34.620
and leave first thing tomorrow.

11:37.940 --> 11:40.500
Brother, please don't argue
with them again.

11:40.740 --> 11:42.180
Just listen to Shang, all right?

11:44.620 --> 11:45.140
(You lot,)

11:45.500 --> 11:46.780
(go get some proper tools!)

11:46.980 --> 11:48.020
(Bring a horse over to help pull!)

11:51.740 --> 11:52.140
Brother!

11:52.860 --> 11:53.220
Brother!

11:53.820 --> 11:54.260
Brother!

11:55.100 --> 11:55.500
Brother!

11:56.340 --> 11:56.780
You can't tear it down!

11:57.260 --> 11:57.860
What are you doing?

11:58.380 --> 11:59.300
This is my house!

11:59.660 --> 12:01.100
Your house is tiny and stuffy.

12:01.220 --> 12:02.260
We'll suffocate in this heat!

12:02.740 --> 12:03.740
- Widen the doorway,
- No!

12:03.780 --> 12:04.380
knock down that wall,

12:04.380 --> 12:05.460
- and we can finally catch a breeze.
- Don't touch anything!

12:08.100 --> 12:10.300
We worked ourselves to the bone
building this house.

12:11.460 --> 12:11.900
Don't worry.

12:15.100 --> 12:15.660
This money

12:15.940 --> 12:17.540
could build you eight or ten houses.

12:20.300 --> 12:20.900
Carry on.

12:21.580 --> 12:22.700
Don't touch my door!

12:23.020 --> 12:24.940
Don't tear it down! Don't! Don't!

12:25.420 --> 12:26.300
You bunch of bandits!

12:26.660 --> 12:27.180
Stop it!

12:27.540 --> 12:28.900
I'll fight you if you touch it!

12:29.380 --> 12:29.780
Hands off!

12:32.220 --> 12:33.340
So it's the heat that's troubling you,
my lady.

12:33.940 --> 12:35.140
We haven't been good hosts.

12:35.820 --> 12:37.460
But this house
is badly in need of repair.

12:37.940 --> 12:38.780
If you tear down a wall,

12:38.980 --> 12:39.780
it may not be safe to stay here.

12:40.140 --> 12:41.620
Wouldn't it be even better
if the house collapsed?

12:42.660 --> 12:44.900
If it crushed the wicked woman like me,
who took over your house,

12:45.500 --> 12:46.740
you'd be thrilled, wouldn't you?

12:47.300 --> 12:47.940
You're our guest.

12:48.300 --> 12:49.460
If you don't mind our humble home,

12:49.780 --> 12:50.820
we'll do our best to treat you well.

12:51.420 --> 12:51.940
Treat me well?

12:54.500 --> 12:54.860
Fine.

12:55.660 --> 12:56.300
I want some wine.

12:56.900 --> 12:57.700
And make sure it's chilled.

12:57.940 --> 12:58.620
Lots of ice.

12:59.940 --> 13:00.940
But you're a woman.

13:01.100 --> 13:02.340
Women can drink too?

13:03.540 --> 13:03.900
Brother!

13:04.460 --> 13:04.860
What?

13:05.540 --> 13:06.380
Is it against the law

13:06.980 --> 13:08.340
for a woman to drink?

13:16.060 --> 13:16.660
Just a moment, my lady.

13:18.340 --> 13:18.620
Here.

13:21.140 --> 13:21.620
Brother.

13:22.660 --> 13:23.140
Brother.

13:23.620 --> 13:25.340
There are still a few jars
of your lychee wine left.

13:25.700 --> 13:27.220
But I don't know where to get any ice.

13:27.220 --> 13:28.300
We can't worry about that right now.

13:28.660 --> 13:30.660
She's just tired and irritable
from the journey.

13:30.940 --> 13:31.900
She's taking it out on our house.

13:32.260 --> 13:32.860
So what do we do?

13:35.420 --> 13:35.980
I'll fetch the wine.

14:00.300 --> 14:01.740
Is that idiot still standing
by the door?

14:02.220 --> 14:03.580
Still guarding his precious wall.

14:03.700 --> 14:04.660
He's terrified we'll tear it down.

14:05.340 --> 14:07.060
Those Yan brothers are quite a pair.

14:07.580 --> 14:08.740
Yan Dalang is dumb as an ox.

14:09.180 --> 14:09.700
Yan Shang

14:10.220 --> 14:11.580
is as timid as a rabbit.

14:14.740 --> 14:15.140
My lady.

14:15.580 --> 14:17.340
Yan Shang has brought
some wine to cool you down.

14:20.660 --> 14:21.540
He actually found some ice?

14:27.860 --> 14:28.340
Where's the ice?

14:30.260 --> 14:31.060
You've come a long way, my lady.

14:31.660 --> 14:32.740
You must be tired.

14:34.140 --> 14:35.460
This is our homemade fruit wine.

14:36.140 --> 14:37.740
Chilled in water till it's cold as ice.

14:38.380 --> 14:39.780
Just right to cool you down
and refresh you.

14:41.500 --> 14:42.660
Cold as ice?

14:43.380 --> 14:44.340
But it's still not ice.

14:45.980 --> 14:46.660
Besides,

14:46.900 --> 14:49.020
I've tasted dozens of fine wines
in Sheng'an,

14:49.740 --> 14:51.780
even a few imported grape wines.

14:52.860 --> 14:54.100
What could your homemade country wine

14:54.660 --> 14:55.740
possibly have to offer?

14:58.220 --> 14:59.500
This wine is called Lingxi.

15:00.260 --> 15:02.860
Legend has it that a white rhinoceros
dug the ground here with its horn,

15:03.260 --> 15:04.100
and a spring burst forth.

15:04.620 --> 15:06.380
From the spring grew a lychee tree,

15:06.980 --> 15:08.540
bearing exquisite blossoms
and fragrant fruit.

15:12.060 --> 15:15.060
This wine is made from the fruit
of that very tree.

15:15.740 --> 15:16.860
Why not give it a try, my lady?

15:17.860 --> 15:18.300
It's a shame

15:18.740 --> 15:19.860
you've come at the wrong time of year.

15:20.260 --> 15:20.940
If you wait until summer,

15:21.340 --> 15:22.780
you can taste fresh lychees too.

15:24.500 --> 15:26.700
Yan Shang, you certainly know
how to spin a tale.

15:28.700 --> 15:29.300
Pour it.

15:52.540 --> 15:53.860
You're quite the smooth talker, Shang.

15:54.540 --> 15:56.340
Why don't you have the first cup?

16:01.340 --> 16:02.100
Truth be told, my lady,

16:02.620 --> 16:03.860
I can't hold my liquor.

16:05.100 --> 16:05.980
Even the smell makes me tipsy.

16:06.580 --> 16:07.100
I'm afraid

16:07.780 --> 16:09.020
I'd only spoil your enjoyment.

16:09.900 --> 16:11.620
People who claim
they can't hold their liquor

16:12.060 --> 16:13.180
usually drink like fish.

16:14.300 --> 16:15.500
Now that you've said that,

16:16.980 --> 16:18.180
there's no way I'm letting you off.

16:20.100 --> 16:21.100
Will you drink it yourself,

16:21.980 --> 16:22.980
or shall I have someone
pour it down your throat?

16:23.420 --> 16:24.940
Who knows
where this wine of yours came from?

16:25.020 --> 16:26.060
And you expect my lady to drink it?

16:26.620 --> 16:27.900
What if you've poisoned it?

16:29.460 --> 16:30.500
If they managed to poison me,

16:31.060 --> 16:32.380
their whole family would celebrate.

16:33.980 --> 16:34.580
Yan Shang.

16:35.260 --> 16:36.300
I don't think your wine

16:36.860 --> 16:37.980
will cool me down.

16:38.820 --> 16:40.540
It's only making my blood boil.

16:53.580 --> 16:55.900
You really do ask the impossible,
my lady.

17:32.260 --> 17:32.940
Impressive drinking!

17:39.460 --> 17:41.380
My lady! The wine's poisoned!

17:54.020 --> 17:54.940
He actually passed out drunk?

18:02.260 --> 18:03.100
Who would've thought?

18:03.740 --> 18:05.340
So that was one thing
he wasn't lying about.

19:14.220 --> 19:14.700
Chunhua!

19:20.020 --> 19:21.660
Since when do geckos make noise?

19:58.660 --> 19:59.820
(The moon here in Lingnan)

20:00.540 --> 20:02.860
(seems so much clearer
than in Sheng'an.)

20:04.300 --> 20:05.620
(If one could live like the Yan family,)

20:06.820 --> 20:08.220
(all together in the mountains,)

20:09.060 --> 20:09.900
(looking after one another,)

20:10.700 --> 20:11.580
(content with simple food and drink...)

20:13.500 --> 20:14.180
(Perhaps)

20:15.420 --> 20:17.020
(that's a rare blessing in this world.)

20:33.340 --> 20:36.060
(Yi Zhi consulted...)

20:46.540 --> 20:47.580
It's the middle of the night.

20:47.940 --> 20:48.660
What are you doing?

20:50.700 --> 20:51.540
It's already the fourth watch.

20:52.100 --> 20:53.140
Why are you still awake, my lady?

20:53.500 --> 20:54.500
Your house is crawling with bugs!

20:56.580 --> 20:58.820
Living in the mountains means sharing
your home with bugs and snakes.

20:59.740 --> 21:00.740
But it's not all bad.

21:03.100 --> 21:03.420
Look.

21:05.580 --> 21:06.260
Fireflies.

21:07.580 --> 21:08.460
Can you really see by that light?

21:09.300 --> 21:10.140
With these fireflies,

21:10.460 --> 21:11.380
I save quite a bit on lamp oil.

21:12.140 --> 21:13.380
I just have to catch new ones often
and replace them as needed,

21:14.180 --> 21:15.140
so they don't die trapped inside.

21:19.780 --> 21:22.180
(Yi Zhi consulted with Wu Xian.)

21:22.420 --> 21:23.260
You can read?

21:24.820 --> 21:25.540
What's that you're writing?

21:26.180 --> 21:26.860
I'm copying a book.

21:27.980 --> 21:28.740
Where's the book?

21:29.260 --> 21:29.780
I've memorized it.

21:44.140 --> 21:45.060
My hand's getting sore.

21:48.980 --> 21:49.460
Thank you.

22:13.180 --> 22:14.060
When I was little,

22:14.940 --> 22:16.740
my mother often took me out
to catch fireflies.

22:20.580 --> 22:21.820
There are fireflies in Sheng'an too?

22:22.860 --> 22:23.540
Of course.

22:30.940 --> 22:31.940
You're so far from home, my lady.

22:32.420 --> 22:33.300
Your mother must be worried.

22:34.020 --> 22:34.540
Perhaps you should

22:34.980 --> 22:35.940
- head home soon...
- That's none of your business!

22:45.740 --> 22:46.900
If you want to stay out here
and enjoy the cool air,

22:47.980 --> 22:48.620
take this

22:49.380 --> 22:50.140
to keep mosquitoes and other bugs away.

23:03.460 --> 23:05.220
Why are the mosquitoes biting me
and not you?

23:06.340 --> 23:07.260
Probably because

23:07.900 --> 23:09.100
you haven't burned any herbal incense.

23:09.860 --> 23:11.580
I've been burning storax incense
in my room.

23:12.420 --> 23:13.620
I even hung up mosquito-repellent
sachets.

23:14.180 --> 23:16.620
Those won't work against Lingnan's
venomous insects.

23:17.260 --> 23:19.300
You need a slow-burning cord
made from herbs you prepare yourself.

23:19.740 --> 23:20.660
Light one before bed.

23:21.100 --> 23:22.100
Then why wasn't there one in my room?

23:24.740 --> 23:25.940
Your attendants

23:26.500 --> 23:27.140
threw them all out.

23:40.340 --> 23:40.820
Don't scratch it.

23:42.380 --> 23:43.020
What is it?

23:52.780 --> 23:53.500
You've got a bug bite

23:54.340 --> 23:55.180
on your face.

24:00.860 --> 24:02.180
Try putting some
of this herbal balm on it.

24:02.660 --> 24:03.340
The swelling should go down soon.

24:12.300 --> 24:13.180
It does smell a little unpleasant,

24:13.660 --> 24:14.180
but give it a try.

24:21.740 --> 24:22.300
A little to the left.

24:24.780 --> 24:25.100
To the right.

24:26.860 --> 24:27.220
Left.

24:28.140 --> 24:28.660
Up a little, to the left.

24:28.860 --> 24:29.620
I can't see it!

24:29.900 --> 24:30.260
You do it.

24:30.580 --> 24:30.860
Here.

24:31.500 --> 24:31.860
Hurry up.

25:13.020 --> 25:13.700
Th-there.

25:30.460 --> 25:31.180
What are you laughing at?

25:32.700 --> 25:33.220
Nothing.

25:34.700 --> 25:35.220
My face

25:35.540 --> 25:36.860
must look ridiculous
after you put that on!

25:37.420 --> 25:37.820
No.

25:38.580 --> 25:38.900
Not at all.

25:39.500 --> 25:40.380
Yan Shang!

25:40.900 --> 25:41.740
How dare you make fun of me!

25:42.300 --> 25:42.620
I...

25:46.460 --> 25:48.180
(Yi Zhi consulted with Wu Xian.)

25:49.940 --> 25:51.700
That rain came out of nowhere.

25:53.500 --> 25:55.180
The rain here never gives you
any warning.

26:04.020 --> 26:04.900
You should get out of the rain, my lady.

26:38.020 --> 26:40.940
(Duke of Zhao's Residence)

28:35.420 --> 28:36.740
Another sleepless night, my lady?

28:37.940 --> 28:38.620
I want to wash up and get dressed.

28:40.340 --> 28:41.020
Just a moment, my lady.

28:41.340 --> 28:42.180
I'll get everything ready.

29:03.420 --> 29:04.060
Everything's ready, my lady.

29:07.820 --> 29:08.420
(What's going on?)

29:08.900 --> 29:10.140
(Why is everything wet?)

29:12.060 --> 29:13.220
My lady, I'll go take a look.

29:20.020 --> 29:20.500
My lady!

29:20.660 --> 29:21.140
My lady!

29:21.780 --> 29:22.260
My lady!

29:22.860 --> 29:24.940
Somehow, your chest of cosmetics
got wet in the rain!

29:26.780 --> 29:28.580
(It's all because your roof leaked
in the middle of the night!)

29:30.060 --> 29:31.060
(You're just trying to bully us!)

30:02.220 --> 30:04.700
My lady, the Yan family's
roof was leaking!

30:05.020 --> 30:06.740
Did anyone force you to stay
in our leaky house?

30:07.660 --> 30:08.540
That's enough, brother!

30:09.380 --> 30:10.140
Serves you right!

30:10.140 --> 30:10.460
Brother!

30:10.540 --> 30:11.180
How dare you speak to me like that!

30:11.180 --> 30:12.180
- I... I'll say what I want!
- Brother!

30:12.180 --> 30:12.620
What's wrong with that?

30:12.740 --> 30:13.060
Brother!

30:13.260 --> 30:14.580
- Stop it, brother!
- (You!)

30:20.500 --> 30:20.940
Don't hurt him!

30:24.820 --> 30:25.300
Move aside!

30:25.700 --> 30:26.900
My brother hasn't done anything wrong!

30:27.340 --> 30:28.300
Why do you look ready to kill him?

30:28.940 --> 30:30.220
Who said I was going to
kill your brother?

30:31.100 --> 30:32.340
I'm disciplining my own servants!

30:37.180 --> 30:38.860
You're going to attack someone
over some rouge?

30:39.260 --> 30:39.860
Is a servant's life

30:39.860 --> 30:41.380
worth less than a few pots of rouge?

30:41.820 --> 30:42.540
I said, get out of my way!

30:42.860 --> 30:43.500
Don't you understand?

30:47.740 --> 30:48.100
No!

30:57.460 --> 30:59.220
Thank you, my lady!
Thank you for sparing me!

30:59.700 --> 31:00.580
I entrusted that chest

31:01.180 --> 31:02.180
to you for safekeeping.

31:03.780 --> 31:04.620
Now that you've messed up,

31:05.580 --> 31:06.980
you think you can pin it on the Yans

31:07.540 --> 31:08.420
and I'll let you off?

31:09.940 --> 31:11.020
You bunch of fools!

31:11.460 --> 31:12.580
Do you take me for an idiot too?

31:12.700 --> 31:13.700
Forgive us, my lady!

31:13.700 --> 31:15.060
It was our fault!

31:15.060 --> 31:16.420
We were careless!

31:18.860 --> 31:19.700
Everyone responsible for this

31:20.420 --> 31:21.740
report to Fang Tong for a whipping.

31:27.780 --> 31:28.620
I thought you were going to...

31:30.300 --> 31:31.700
You thought I was a spoiled tyrant

31:31.980 --> 31:32.820
who kills people on a whim?

31:39.300 --> 31:39.780
You're right.

31:41.180 --> 31:42.180
That's exactly the kind of person I am.

32:02.060 --> 32:02.660
My lady.

32:43.780 --> 32:44.340
I don't need your help.

32:44.900 --> 32:46.340
Rain can come out of nowhere
this time of year.

32:46.900 --> 32:47.740
I'll get an umbrella, then.

33:04.420 --> 33:04.820
Miss.

33:05.460 --> 33:07.060
Was that rouge very expensive?

33:08.900 --> 33:09.620
It's not about the money.

33:09.820 --> 33:10.500
It was precious to her.

33:11.220 --> 33:11.660
You wouldn't understand.

33:13.100 --> 33:13.460
You're right.

33:15.300 --> 33:16.820
I really don't understand
what happened this morning.

33:17.540 --> 33:18.700
Could you help me make sense of it?

33:19.340 --> 33:20.020
That rouge...

33:20.380 --> 33:21.860
She takes it everywhere she goes.

33:22.340 --> 33:23.220
She can barely bring herself to use it.

33:23.700 --> 33:24.540
And now it's all ruined.

33:24.900 --> 33:25.980
You men would never understand.

33:32.820 --> 33:33.660
Is that all there is to it?

33:37.380 --> 33:38.460
The rest is none of your business.

33:45.020 --> 33:46.740
You'd better hurry and apologize
to my lady.

33:47.020 --> 33:48.300
She's really furious today.

33:51.500 --> 33:52.460
Thank you for the advice.

33:53.060 --> 33:54.940
But she's still angry now.

33:56.100 --> 33:57.780
Perhaps I should prepare
a generous gift by way of apology

33:58.180 --> 33:59.820
and present it when she leaves,

34:00.180 --> 34:00.980
as a farewell gift too.

34:01.500 --> 34:02.180
I just wonder...

34:02.780 --> 34:03.980
When is she planning to leave?

34:06.260 --> 34:06.780
Well...

34:08.100 --> 34:08.980
I'll ask her for you.

34:09.460 --> 34:09.900
Thank you.

34:11.020 --> 34:11.420
Yan Shang!

34:12.100 --> 34:12.980
Listen carefully!

34:13.980 --> 34:15.340
I love traveling far from home,

34:15.900 --> 34:17.180
and I love staying in your shabby house!

34:17.580 --> 34:18.940
I'll stay as long as I please!

34:20.100 --> 34:21.260
Cross me again,

34:21.740 --> 34:23.380
and you'll get far worse than a slap!

34:24.540 --> 34:25.340
I might even

34:25.860 --> 34:27.300
tear your entire house to the ground.

34:29.780 --> 34:30.620
Bring me another jar of wine.

34:44.380 --> 34:45.300
After all that,

34:45.620 --> 34:47.420
I doubt she'll leave that easily now.

34:48.620 --> 34:49.780
With a temper like hers,

34:49.980 --> 34:50.940
if she stays much longer,

34:51.300 --> 34:52.620
there could be serious trouble.

34:54.580 --> 34:56.060
Just who is this woman?

35:03.140 --> 35:03.580
Xiaozhou.

35:04.180 --> 35:05.100
I need to get to the local school.

35:05.580 --> 35:06.340
Our brother can be rather careless.

35:06.900 --> 35:08.420
Please keep a close eye on things
at home.

35:09.100 --> 35:09.420
Sure.

35:18.220 --> 35:21.180
(Diligent Study, Steadfast Practice)
A gentleman follows the Way,

35:22.020 --> 35:23.780
but may give up halfway.

35:24.740 --> 35:27.260
I could never bring myself to stop.

35:28.140 --> 35:30.620
A gentleman holds fast
to the Middle Way.

35:31.460 --> 35:34.580
Though he lives in obscurity,

35:34.980 --> 35:36.420
he has no regrets.

35:37.060 --> 35:40.220
Only a sage can achieve this.

35:42.540 --> 35:43.260
In my opinion,

35:43.860 --> 35:45.193
(Learning without thought is labor lost;
thought without learning is perilous.)

35:45.194 --> 35:45.740
Whether the Way prevails or not,

35:46.260 --> 35:47.740
a man born into this world should

35:48.060 --> 35:48.860
serve the people and keep the peace,

35:49.020 --> 35:50.020
be loyal to his ruler and country.

35:50.500 --> 35:51.420
That is what a true man should do.

35:51.580 --> 35:53.060
And you, Shang?

35:53.580 --> 35:55.140
What do you think?

35:55.540 --> 35:57.580
Master, I have no desire
to pursue strange, obscure ways.

35:58.060 --> 35:59.220
Nor could I live in seclusion,
unknown to the world.

36:00.220 --> 36:01.340
Those things feel far beyond me.

36:01.820 --> 36:03.060
They're not beyond you.

36:03.500 --> 36:06.860
You simply haven't found
your own Way yet.

36:18.540 --> 36:22.020
♪Moonlight shimmers upon the pond♪

36:22.700 --> 36:26.140
♪Riding a bamboo horse
past the red pond♪

36:26.620 --> 36:30.020
♪The water's too deep to cross♪

36:30.460 --> 36:33.900
♪A maiden rows to fetch her love♪

36:35.460 --> 36:36.180
(Diligent Study, Steadfast Practice)
(Yan Shang, we're off!)

36:36.180 --> 36:36.540
(Heading home.)

36:36.620 --> 36:37.060
(We'll take our leave.)

36:37.060 --> 36:38.460
Yan Shang, have you finished
copying my book?

36:38.820 --> 36:39.260
All done.

36:41.220 --> 36:42.660
Yan Shang,
have you finished my policy essay?

36:43.100 --> 36:43.900
Take a look and see if it's all right.

36:44.420 --> 36:44.860
No need.

36:45.140 --> 36:46.260
Everything you ghostwrite is excellent.

36:47.100 --> 36:48.220
Here. Your payment.

36:48.740 --> 36:49.140
- (Let's go.)
- (Go.)

36:50.220 --> 36:50.500
(Let's go!)

36:50.940 --> 36:51.380
Yan Shang.

36:51.700 --> 36:52.500
I have to go now.

36:52.780 --> 36:54.300
Mind clearing my desk for me?

36:54.500 --> 36:54.780
Sure.

36:57.340 --> 36:58.820
Liu Wenji, what'd you hit me for?

36:58.980 --> 37:00.500
Shang works for the local school,

37:00.660 --> 37:01.620
not for you.

37:01.860 --> 37:02.780
You've got plenty of servants at home.

37:02.940 --> 37:03.900
Why not have them clean up after you?

37:06.460 --> 37:10.340
(Liu Wenji, Son of the Shaozhou Prefect,
Yan Shang's Classmate)

37:10.980 --> 37:11.380
Wenji.

37:12.140 --> 37:12.900
It's no big deal.

37:13.180 --> 37:13.900
No need to get upset.

37:15.380 --> 37:16.460
(Diligent Study, Steadfast Practice)
The more accommodating you are,

37:16.660 --> 37:17.980
the more they'll walk all over you.

37:19.180 --> 37:19.940
I promise you,

37:20.220 --> 37:22.060
even if you beat them all up tomorrow,

37:22.620 --> 37:23.140
as long as I'm around,

37:23.500 --> 37:25.260
you can still work and study here.

37:25.780 --> 37:26.180
All right.

37:26.780 --> 37:28.420
Then I'll beat them all up tomorrow.

37:30.140 --> 37:31.180
Even without me,

37:31.420 --> 37:32.580
they'd never let you leave.

37:33.020 --> 37:34.460
What would anyone do without you?

37:41.620 --> 37:43.020
Yesterday, I was copying
official documents for my father.

37:43.300 --> 37:45.820
I read this month's latest copy
of the court bulletin.

37:48.100 --> 37:49.460
Anything major happening lately?

37:49.940 --> 37:50.660
Nothing major.

37:51.020 --> 37:52.580
But there was one rather interesting
little story.

37:54.140 --> 37:55.660
Apparently, Princess Danyang
is a devoted daughter.

37:55.980 --> 37:58.260
She traveled all the way
from Sheng'an to Mount Lufu

37:58.380 --> 38:00.340
to pray for the late Empress
and perform rites for her soul.

38:00.820 --> 38:01.660
By my reckoning,

38:02.140 --> 38:03.020
she should be in Lingnan by now.

38:03.420 --> 38:05.900
Every prefecture along the route
has prepared a grand welcome.

38:07.100 --> 38:08.140
After all, she's now

38:08.580 --> 38:10.700
His Majesty's only beloved daughter.

38:11.580 --> 38:12.580
But guess what?

38:13.940 --> 38:14.420
What?

38:15.420 --> 38:17.020
Not a single prefecture has seen her.

38:18.220 --> 38:19.180
Strange, isn't it?

38:22.140 --> 38:23.780
(So she's Princess Danyang.)

38:26.820 --> 38:27.780
(Then forgive me, Your Highness.)

38:27.780 --> 38:29.020
(Merit Through the Ages)

38:29.020 --> 38:30.020
(Our humble home)

38:30.620 --> 38:32.340
(is no place for someone
of your royal standing.)

38:33.220 --> 38:35.020
(And my family can't afford
any more trouble.)

38:35.020 --> 38:40.980
(Santu County Office)

38:40.980 --> 38:41.660
What do you want?

38:43.300 --> 38:43.820
Sir,

38:44.500 --> 38:46.100
something strange happened to me today.

38:46.780 --> 38:47.580
After giving it some thought,

38:47.980 --> 38:49.020
I decided I should report it
to the magistrate.

38:49.580 --> 38:50.580
What's so strange about it?

38:51.940 --> 38:53.380
I was passing through Caimei Ridge today

38:53.780 --> 38:54.660
when I came across a carriage.

38:55.260 --> 38:57.700
There was a lady inside who claimed
to be Princess Danyang.

38:58.260 --> 38:59.100
(Chen Da, Santu County Bailiff)
She'd gotten lost in the mountains

38:59.460 --> 39:00.260
and was looking for someone
from the prefectural office.

39:00.780 --> 39:02.180
(Merit Through the Ages)

39:02.180 --> 39:03.020
Princess Danyang?

39:03.660 --> 39:04.620
Are you sure you heard that right?

39:06.420 --> 39:07.740
I think that's what I heard.

39:08.700 --> 39:09.420
(Zhang Renjing,
Captain of the Shence Army)

39:09.420 --> 39:09.980
This journey

39:11.540 --> 39:12.460
has completely worn me out.

39:14.940 --> 39:16.180
I'm lucky you've taken
such good care of me.

39:17.060 --> 39:18.540
Oh, think nothing of it!

39:19.020 --> 39:20.420
Once you arrive in Sheng'an, Captain,

39:20.780 --> 39:22.260
and catch Lord Yu's eye,

39:22.540 --> 39:25.060
you'll have a brilliant career
ahead of you!

39:25.500 --> 39:26.860
Oh, I wouldn't count on that.

39:27.980 --> 39:29.900
Lord Yu is a man of great stature!

39:30.540 --> 39:31.660
(Zheng Chengqing, County Magistrate)
If he even recognizes me,

39:31.980 --> 39:33.740
I'd consider myself blessed
beyond belief.

39:34.300 --> 39:35.380
You're too modest, Captain.

39:41.340 --> 39:42.060
What do you think you're doing?

39:42.100 --> 39:42.980
Can't you see the captain's here?

39:43.660 --> 39:46.220
I've found a lead on Princess Danyang's
whereabouts.

39:47.940 --> 39:48.580
Are you certain?

39:49.060 --> 39:50.020
Absolutely certain!

39:50.300 --> 39:52.060
Someone spotted her at Caimei Ridge!

39:53.180 --> 39:53.580
Your Honor,

39:54.260 --> 39:55.980
once you find the princess tomorrow,

39:56.300 --> 39:58.300
invite her to stay at our county office.

39:58.860 --> 40:00.820
Then the prefect himself will surely
pay us a visit!

40:02.940 --> 40:04.420
Gather a troop of men at once.

40:04.580 --> 40:05.340
Prepare some lavish gifts.

40:05.660 --> 40:07.300
I'll pay my respects
to Her Highness myself tomorrow.

40:07.540 --> 40:07.980
Yes, sir! Right away!

40:10.500 --> 40:11.380
Come, Captain. Another drink!

40:11.940 --> 40:12.780
No more, no more.

40:13.460 --> 40:14.180
I should get going.

40:14.780 --> 40:16.020
Can't afford to fall behind schedule.

40:16.620 --> 40:17.100
Of course, of course!

40:17.500 --> 40:18.340
Watch your step.

40:18.340 --> 40:18.860
All right, all right.

40:19.780 --> 40:20.260
No need to see me out.

40:20.740 --> 40:21.180
Okay.

40:21.180 --> 40:21.860
No need to come any farther.

40:56.020 --> 40:58.020
(Santu County Office
Merit Through the Ages)

41:10.340 --> 41:12.340
(Santu County Office)

41:16.140 --> 41:17.220
Out of my way!

41:19.660 --> 41:19.980
(Santu County Office)
Get lost!

41:30.340 --> 41:31.980
(Santu County Office)

41:33.500 --> 41:33.780
Go!

41:38.220 --> 41:40.300
(Merit Through the Ages)

41:48.700 --> 41:49.580
(It's him.)

41:53.140 --> 41:55.300
(He's actually still alive.)

42:00.100 --> 42:04.740
(Next Episode Preview)

42:04.980 --> 42:05.740
I want to get out of here.

42:06.140 --> 42:07.020
She's an honored guest from Sheng'an.

42:07.020 --> 42:08.220
She could give me that chance.

42:08.460 --> 42:09.860
You think groveling at her feet

42:09.860 --> 42:11.060
will send you soaring through the ranks?

42:11.500 --> 42:12.580
Better than living like you,

42:12.860 --> 42:14.540
hiding in this wretched backwater
your whole life,

42:14.540 --> 42:15.980
shutting out the world like a coward!

42:16.340 --> 42:17.700
Have you no shame?

42:21.120 --> 42:24.413
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

42:27.098 --> 42:32.014
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

42:34.208 --> 42:40.053
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

42:40.553 --> 42:45.779
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

42:48.548 --> 42:53.339
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

42:54.175 --> 43:00.254
♪Through trails of mud and blood;
let grief drown in your eyes♪

43:02.055 --> 43:05.205
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

43:05.205 --> 43:06.853
♪Burning bright as a song♪

43:06.905 --> 43:10.629
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

43:11.007 --> 43:15.673
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

43:16.292 --> 43:20.333
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

43:20.824 --> 43:22.939
♪Not a single hour less♪

43:22.979 --> 43:29.925
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

43:30.688 --> 43:34.141
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

43:34.321 --> 43:37.466
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

43:37.905 --> 43:44.542
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

43:44.939 --> 43:49.453
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

43:49.491 --> 43:51.960
♪You're the only one I need♪

43:52.164 --> 43:59.051
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

43:59.363 --> 44:02.634
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

44:02.939 --> 44:06.112
♪My last untouched innocence♪

44:06.436 --> 44:09.862
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

44:10.095 --> 44:13.320
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

44:13.651 --> 44:20.447
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

44:20.816 --> 44:25.382
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

